{"id":"n14014-1-7","stage":0,"title":"연락처 · 联系方式","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14014-1-7-1","ko":"다음에 어디로 연락을 드리면 되죠?","zh":"之后应该怎么联系您呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음에","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음에","audio":"/audio/2a722c75f1d5ba8ef482.mp3"}},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디로","audio":"/audio/0fbbfd5af1ab3c98e173.mp3"}},{"text":"연락을","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락을","audio":"/audio/8656320bd794bb5740d9.mp3"}},{"text":"드리면","meaning":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：给、奉上（谦敬表达）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드리면","audio":"/audio/b2338136b63b7c2c8f07.mp3"}},{"text":"되죠?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되죠","audio":"/audio/3ff4337d8fc3f95c4d8f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"b1c3b94a6a87c1f5","term":"연락","zh":"联络，联系","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3","entryId":"14013","definition":"传达告知某个事实。","pronunciation":["열락"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ba8def3aba50b7477991.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14014-1-7-2","ko":"제가 연락처를 드릴게요.","zh":"我把联系方式给您。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"연락처를","meaning":"联系方式","explanation":"연락처：联系方式；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"연락처","audio":"/audio/67c1e932f9bc7bd77503.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14014","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락처를","audio":"/audio/e73e8fc6718ddaad0b9c.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：给、奉上（谦敬表达）；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴게요","audio":"/audio/e61f9f5edc04f979cd3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"67c1e932f9bc7bd7","term":"연락